        <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Public Service Assistant at Punjab Police, studying Computer Science at MultanUST. Learning
          cybersecurity, networking, and automation along the way.
        </p>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn-ripple relative overflow-hidden px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 via-red-500 to-red-600 rounded-full font-semibold text-white hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/40 transition-all text-center">
            Get In Touch
          </a>
          <a href="/imran-mazhar-resume.pdf" download class="btn-ripple relative overflow-hidden px-8 py-4 glass rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-slate-700/50 transition-all text-center">
            Download CV
